 * receive-tokens.compact
 *
 * Pins the receive patterns described in midnightntwrk/midnight-docs#1635
 * for Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23.
 *
 * Official sources only:
 * - https://docs.midnight.network/examples/contracts/token-transfers
 * - https://docs.midnight.network/tutorials/private-tip-jar/smart-contract
 * - https://docs.midnight.network/tutorials/private-party/smart-contract
 * - https://docs.midnight.network/compact/standard-library/exports
 * - https://docs.midnight.network/tokens/overview
 *
 * receiveUnshielded claims an unshielded amount of a color for this contract;
 * the caller's wallet supplies the funds when balancing the transaction.
 * receiveShielded claims a ShieldedCoinInfo (typically a fresh coin the client
 * constructs); the wallet pays by creating the matching Zswap output.
 * insertCoin stores a QualifiedShieldedCoinInfo so the contract can later spend it.
 *
 * LOCAL-TRUE. Source only. Not compiled or deployed here.
 * Does not claim a fix of the public indexer or node.
